## 7. C4 context checklist

### Evidence gate

- [ ] `## Evidence` section filled with overall status + telemetry source
- [ ] Every persona claim backed by real data source (logs, signup funnel)
- [ ] External systems confirmed via outbound connection log
- [ ] Diagram nodes match real running services (no invented clients)
- [ ] >=50% of references are `[verified]`

### Coverage

- [ ] Persona list captures all user types (2-3 ideal)
- [ ] Each persona has goal + interaction surface + volume
- [ ] In-scope vs out-of-scope stated explicitly
- [ ] External systems table has direction + protocol + data
- [ ] Diagram renders in mermaid live editor without syntax errors
- [ ] Diagram has <= 10 nodes total
- [ ] File committed to `dissects/<system>/wiki/c4-context.md`
- [ ] Cross-link from `wiki/index.md` works